From: Codex local compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Guard absent A376B Knox TAProxy patch target

Reason: `attempt17.txt:1045` reports TAProxy.smali missing from services.jar. AZH4 source has no Knox DAR TAProxy class, so the upstream product-shipping API replacement cannot apply. Skip only this absent class edit for the exact A376B16 profile; retain MAINLINE_API_LEVEL edits and other substitutions.
Files: unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh.
Verification: extracted class inventory, shell syntax and clean build18.

---
--- a/unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh
@@ -45,11 +45,15 @@
             "$SOURCE_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL" \
             "$TARGET_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL"
     fi
-    SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" \
-        "smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/ddar/ta/TAProxy.smali" "replace" \
-        "updateServiceHolder(Z)V" \
-        "$SOURCE_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL" \
-        "$TARGET_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL"
+    if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ]; then
+        LOGW "A376B AZH4 services.jar has no Knox TAProxy class; skipping its inapplicable shipping-API substitution"
+    else
+        SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" \
+            "smali/com/android/server/knox/dar/ddar/ta/TAProxy.smali" "replace" \
+            "updateServiceHolder(Z)V" \
+            "$SOURCE_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL" \
+            "$TARGET_PRODUCT_SHIPPING_API_LEVEL"
+    fi
     SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/framework/services.jar" \
         "smali/com/android/server/SystemServer.smali" "replace" \
         "startOtherServices(Lcom/android/server/utils/TimingsTraceAndSlog;)V" \
